{
  "schema": "DesignTokens@v1",
  "_about": [
    "THE source of the Command Center v3 design tokens (AGENTS.md §28.13, design/README.md).",
    "scripts/gen_design_tokens.py renders apps/command-center-v3/src/styles/tokens.css from this file;",
    "the app imports only the generated CSS. Edit a value here, run the generator, commit both.",
    "themes.<theme>.<name> holds every value once. layout is the CSS file line by line: a",
    "placeholder {theme.name} renders as 'name: value;'. Every value must be used by layout at",
    "least once and every placeholder must resolve (the generator refuses otherwise)."
  ],
