  "layout": [
    "/* Command Center v3 design tokens (PR1, 2026-09-27) — THE only place a colour literal lives",
    "   (mirrored for TypeScript in src/lib/designTokens.ts). Semantic names only:",
    "",
    "     success  = positive outcome / ready / winning        (green)",
    "     warning  = watch / caution / needs review            (yellow-amber)",
    "     danger   = risk / breach / loss / error              (red)",
    "     info     = informational / links / neutral emphasis  (blue)",
    "     ai       = AI-sourced insight or decision            (purple)",
    "     neutral  = nothing notable                           (slate)",
    "",
    "   Every tone has -color (text/stroke on a page background), -bg (soft fill) and -border.",
    "   Both themes must pass WCAG 2.1 AA (scripts/check_token_contrast.mjs runs in the build):",
    "   text-0..3 on bg-0..3 >= 4.5:1, tone -color on bg-0..2 >= 4.5:1, tone -color on its own",
    "   -bg >= 4.5:1. Type scale is locked to 10/11/12/14/18/24 (nothing below 10). Spacing is",
    "   the 4-point grid. Legacy names (--green, --bg0, ...) are aliased in index.css until every",
    "   consumer is converted; new code uses the semantic names only. */",
    "",
    ":root,",
    "[data-theme=\"dark\"] {",
    "  {dark.color-scheme}",
    "",
    "  {dark.--bg-0}",
    "  {dark.--bg-1}",
    "  {dark.--bg-2}",
    "  {dark.--bg-3}",
    "  {dark.--border-color}",
    "  {dark.--border-subtle}",
    "",
    "  {dark.--text-0}",
    "  {dark.--text-1}",
    "  {dark.--text-2}",
    "  {dark.--text-3}",
    "",
    "  {dark.--success-color}",
    "  {dark.--success-bg}",
    "  {dark.--success-border}",
    "  {dark.--warning-color}",
    "  {dark.--warning-bg}",
    "  {dark.--warning-border}",
    "  {dark.--danger-color}",
    "  {dark.--danger-bg}",
    "  {dark.--danger-border}",
    "  {dark.--info-color}",
    "  {dark.--info-bg}",
    "  {dark.--info-border}",
    "  {dark.--ai-color}",
    "  {dark.--ai-bg}",
    "  {dark.--ai-border}",
    "  {dark.--neutral-color}",
    "  {dark.--neutral-bg}",
    "  {dark.--neutral-border}",
    "",
    "  {dark.--primary-color}",
    "  {dark.--secondary-color}",
    "  {dark.--focus-ring}",
    "",
    "  {dark.--chart-1}",
    "  {dark.--chart-2}",
    "  {dark.--chart-3}",
    "  {dark.--chart-4}",
    "  {dark.--chart-5}",
    "  {dark.--chart-6}",
    "}",
    "",
    "[data-theme=\"light\"] {",
